{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9eba83474e73940e7a258c764ab3e110e54304c982e15dfbe1d66dbf327ad106", "ja": "（先日、初舞台を終えたばかりの風花に、\nグラビアのオファーが届いた！　早く伝えないと……）", "zh": "（前几天刚结束首次舞台演出的风花，收到了写真拍摄的邀约！得赶紧告诉她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dc7bae54a3e0e8244fea81be6d5769e44b3bf5b8f64bd43edb58b58e6bab834f", "ja": "いたいた！\n風花、ビッグニュースだぞ！", "zh": "找到了！\n风花，有个大好消息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "71072ada2be01a1bb5d3e20bdc36713cf6d9450c522730729e601be1f761a2b0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん？\nそんなに慌てて、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生？\n这么慌慌张张的，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3af829ad56409212670c722b4c159036da9b1c61c909f6c90b638ec12cc3e237", "ja": "風花に、仕事のオファーがきたんだ。\n初公演を観に来た雑誌社の人から、ぜひって。", "zh": "有杂志社的人来看了风花的首场公演，说无论如何都想请她，所以给她发来了工作邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5d365935b89c57b5c5429dc623bd24d8fd61c7b0bb1215fef61ea5663dfa0026", "ja": "ええっ！？　ほ、本当ですか！？", "zh": "诶！？真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "75bf83fe3c1e67d6e5827f24d66597fee46edb6d133b56e5cd5702f272c90e9f", "ja": "ああ。初舞台を踏んだばかりでオファーが来るなんて、\nそう多くないんだが……やったな、風花！", "zh": "是啊。刚登上初舞台就能接到邀约，\n这种情况可不多见……干得漂亮，风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f8be532d02fa8efc396122d2c9f53d379f6848f7ed5bdca9e0b01f48939437a7", "ja": "は、はい！\nそれで、どんなお仕事なんですか？", "zh": "是、是的！\n那么，是什么工作呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0fa3dea62719b0c7f91f7eb2182cb87bfeddcf8810900c0c0643708f7026161c", "ja": "青年誌のグラビアだ！\n風花の水着姿を、撮らせてほしいそうだ。", "zh": "是青年杂志的写真拍摄！\n对方想请风花拍摄穿泳装的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "534c0447e35a98ba47d9cf692dfc214edf54bd21e2b33d48d6d36f772ee1a07f", "ja": "み、水着のグラビアですか！？", "zh": "泳、泳装写真吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "38fbc5390a2c5f2692d126a3dbc2178d53dda76cbaa2427c53895a547b7fc985", "ja": "そうだけど……何か、問題でもあるのか？", "zh": "是这样没错……怎么，有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2d8799e499ad60e71a1d1dbe001e46c9a08ea8b8bf5109a23d2ca8bcfcd82124", "ja": "いえ……お、お仕事をいただけるのは、\nとっても嬉しいんですけど、その……。", "zh": "不是……能接到工作，我当然非常开心，只是那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a1f3d89fe47a247e1be41de7045aa93efea9737ac18ce655fd9eeecf03d46b39", "ja": "自分の水着姿を、大勢の人に見られるって思うと、\nちょっと……恥ずかしいっていうか……。", "zh": "一想到自己的泳装模样会被那么多人看到，就觉得有点……该说是害羞吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4eefd654a6db3bd4719f87d6edd407cd0314af41b841905214b56674f4b6b0e0", "ja": "それに……私のなりたいアイドル像と、\n違っていっちゃうのかな？って……。", "zh": "而且……会不会也和我想成为的偶像形象，越来越不一样了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1013_p", "source_sha256": "72a0e28e3068981b3784c920280a06da1f28b95f2fdb4a91733caf47241f094a", "ja": "なりたいアイドル像……\nそうか、風花は確か正統派アイドルに……。", "zh": "想成为的偶像形象……\n这样啊，风花确实是想成为正统派偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4d8413f7752f1f4097d60a201c94fe2014547f7c3acb13eda34ddbe1a6be1096", "ja": "はいっ！　そうなんです！", "zh": "是的！就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fd4860b728d82c8b5a8316e2354133bc1e20224e7ee4f57c9edcc45bc8707040", "ja": "けど、どうして正統派アイドルがいいんだ？\n詳しい理由は、聞いた事がなかったと思うけど……。", "zh": "可是，为什么想当正统派偶像呢？\n我好像还没听你说过具体的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "44962b9fe1ccd65e67b3af65cedb739b0b29c73e27db0d9c4b1bbb843966f876", "ja": "それは……私、みんなに元気になってもらえる、\nそんなアイドルになりたいんです。", "zh": "那是因为……我想成为能让大家打起精神来的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cc19f739bf57f29af82429ed48cbbbdc39d11eaf5ec28e7f9eb5b539df710994", "ja": "病院で働いてた時、病気やケガをしてしまった人達を、\nたくさん看てきました。", "zh": "我在医院工作时，照顾过许多生病或受伤的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7254e0c14ba2138e56065cd5a29072a472e55265d8d3daa17a15fa804c51ee71", "ja": "私、患者さんのお世話をすることはできますけど。\n笑顔にしてあげることまでは、できなくって。", "zh": "我能照顾患者，但却没办法让他们展露笑颜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8ffc586145de884b36c4b3d69cd967266478aa7ef875cc187c6f01b48e89dca6", "ja": "そうか……。\nでも、看護師だって尊い仕事だよ。", "zh": "这样啊……\n\n不过，护士也是一份高尚的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c673d0423869de0b63797cb1898e71c7fae5504ee090d8c9a0f7ddb6be9b4072", "ja": "はい、それはもちろんわかってます！\nなので、頑張っていました。でも、ある日……。", "zh": "是的，这些我当然明白！\n所以，我一直在努力。但是，有一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c3443c5bade6fdc3dca0d2cfc49a5ae910d6d21ff4a24e2f690445e96544510f", "ja": "病院に、アイドルが慰問に来てくれたんです。いつもは\n辛そうな患者さん達が、みんなすごく楽しそうで……。", "zh": "偶像来医院慰问了。平时看起来都很痛苦的患者们，全都开心极了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e56eb64d5e6e81c3cf470c394c9b2f905c5d94f1b555243a9b4d8ba2231f0b35", "ja": "それを見て、私、「これだ！」って思ったんです。", "zh": "看到那一幕，我就觉得：“就是这个！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d5ee0628252b76e89951b4f7163d034d923dc5cd60bfcf13303eb95a424f0211", "ja": "アイドルなら……アイドルになれば、\n患者さんを、心からの笑顔にできるんじゃないかって！", "zh": "如果成为偶像……成为偶像的话，\n是不是就能让患者们发自内心地露出笑容了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1024_p", "source_sha256": "25838c906603d9a2355473092b4ca3a4a8b933848511dabd4f2747fc56115f3c", "ja": "なるほど、それで正統派アイドルに……。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才成为了正统派偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4fb2a4faf8fbea860a5d59eaf2c24be2a6abf5dc2ba7534c32e2b4b3d9debc72", "ja": "はい……。あ、なんだか、ちょっと大げさですね。\nごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "是的……啊，总觉得，好像有点夸张了。\n对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9d3e81661b6030e33b012a1e1622d45505f82293b978aa4e8f6c5e8fae2effcd", "ja": "私に、みんなを笑顔にするチカラなんて、\n全然ないかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "我也许根本没有让大家露出笑容的力量，\n也说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b26b6877335b04ea65bd4285542303649609f44e87ef9e02360da0f9bc26b58e", "ja": "でも、ダメ元で受けてみたオーディションに、こうして\n合格しましたし。やってみなくちゃわかりませんよね♪", "zh": "不过，抱着试试看的心态参加了试镜，结果就这样通过了。所以不试试看是不会知道的，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "11e416dbc0ea365413c755ac3921792019d40a8cd87f5e4266f84245cc2c2177", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n挑戦してみなくちゃわからない、その通りだと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。\n不去挑战一下，就不会知道结果，我也这么认为。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ce2493daa047c6ba842b6151368a148ee8a6f6cfe35d2372b1074249607e51c5", "ja": "それに、風花のその気持ちをより多くの人に\n届けられるようにすることが、俺の仕事だからな。", "zh": "而且，让更多人感受到风花的这份心意，也是我的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f69c77beb4b2cce8c81cec4f11365658e0f2460283b9ffe3221c3bcde1e425c6", "ja": "けどそのためには、風花のことをもっと大勢の人に\n知ってもらって、仕事を増やす必要がある。", "zh": "不过，为此需要让更多人了解风花，增加她的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "672669c471738b461963867190044d6f76f23d2ca386f625dde95ac037342880", "ja": "だから、第一希望とは違うかもしれないけど……\nまずはグラビア、頑張ってみないか？", "zh": "所以，虽然可能和你的第一志愿不一样……先从写真工作开始，努力试试看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3677f1e7053e94c99672519a1a6384bc47713aee4915f03a73f8ebd63dd82446", "ja": "そう、ですよね。\nどのお仕事も、大事なお仕事ですよね……。", "zh": "是的，没错。\n每一份工作，都是很重要的工作呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4aa889f8592f68ecd2eb354b633ef36dde7e6950bb4ebb14de756d0b790ecfb6", "ja": "わかりました！　恥ずかしいですけど、\nこれも最初の第一歩ですから……やってみます！", "zh": "我明白了！虽然很不好意思，\n但这也是最初的第一步……我会试着做做看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c7e5597d7587d81de31fe0537070fea4df16a29510fa585c003db0e76ce5aa6e", "ja": "あっ！　でも、目指すのは正統派アイドルだってこと、\n忘れないでくださいね？", "zh": "啊！不过，请您可别忘了，\n我的目标是成为正统派偶像哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_004_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b135915888767cc14f9e7d87107a4977ce1afa0e6606a86a38df6a4ec301a8ae", "ja": "（忘れるわけがない。\nアイドルの夢は、俺の夢だ！）", "zh": "（我不可能忘记。\n偶像的梦想，就是我的梦想！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
